Read `AGENTS.md` as the canonical project contract.

Keep this rule lean. Before work, open only the task-relevant spec/skill.

Never regress into a generic local-service template. Public UI must be mobile-first, visually specific to the one-car restoration story, and truthful about bookings, capacity, reviews and sponsors.

For public visual work read `docs/VISUAL-DIRECTION.md` and `docs/STORY.md`.
For admin/booking read `docs/STUDIO-OS.md`.
For sponsors read `docs/SPONSORS.md`.
For context/token discipline read `docs/AI-CONTEXT.md`.
